  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ae16ab65b915547",
      "translationZh": "🧭 太长不看版——为什么写这篇博文？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d80736970c3893ce",
      "translationZh": "在这篇文章中，我们将：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a5dbcd13760b8b54",
      "translationZh": "认识社区贡献的 LeRobot 数据集日益增长的影响力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4a291ec03849058d",
      "translationZh": "重点介绍当前机器人数据采集与整理面临的挑战",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d8fbf802378e656e",
      "translationZh": "分享切实可行的步骤和最佳实践，以最大限度地发挥这一集体努力的影响力。我们的目标是将泛化界定为一个数据问题，并展示构建一个开放、多样的“机器人领域的 ImageNet”不仅是可能的，而且已经在进行之中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b605350bc0020952",
      "translationZh": "引言",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee9ca7febd84203c",
      "translationZh": "视觉-语言-动作（VLA）模型的最新进展，使机器人能够执行广泛的任务——从“抓住方块”这样的简单指令，到叠衣服或清理桌子等更复杂的活动。这些模型旨在实现泛化：即在全新场景中、面对未见过的物体以及在不同条件下执行任务的能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b007319104323937",
      "translationZh": "“机器人领域最大的挑战不是灵巧性，而是跨越物理、视觉和语义层面的泛化能力。”——Physical Intelligence",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80d0d456e4d57999",
      "translationZh": "机器人必须“弄清楚如何在新环境中或使用新物体正确完成哪怕是一项简单的任务”，而这既需要稳健的技能，也需要对世界具备常识性的理解。然而，这类机器人系统的进展往往受限于多样化数据的可获得性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2060afde32e6bf54",
      "translationZh": "“泛化必须发生在多个层面。在底层，机器人必须理解如何拿起勺子（握住勺柄）或盘子（抓住边缘），即使它以前从未见过这些特定的勺子或盘子，即使它们被放在一堆脏餐具中。在更高层面，机器人必须理解每项任务的语义——衣服和鞋子应该放在哪里（理想情况下是放进洗衣篮或衣柜，而不是放在床上），以及什么样的工具适合擦拭洒出的液体。这种泛化既需要稳健的物理技能，也需要对环境具备常识性的理解，从而使机器人能够同时在物理、视觉乃至语义等多个层面实现泛化。这类机器人系统可获得的多样化数据有限，使这一切变得更加困难。”——Physical Intelligence",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7667cd8356d441aa",
      "translationZh": "从模型到数据：视角的转变",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0ca7de253debc48",
      "translationZh": "简单来说，通用策略的核心在于一个简单的想法：在异构数据集上进行联合训练。通过让 VLA 模型接触各种环境、任务以及不同的机器人具身形态，我们不仅可以教会模型如何行动，还可以教会它们为何这样行动——如何解读场景、理解目标，并让技能适应不同情境。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59f859de62ad7deb",
      "translationZh": "💡“泛化不仅是模型的一种属性，更是一种数据现象。”它源于训练数据的多样性、质量和抽象层次。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7993afee3eb20960",
      "translationZh": "这就引出了一个根本性问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d204a9e678a8f252",
      "translationZh": "基于当前的数据集，我们可以期待的泛化能力上限是什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce35f151f60cf097",
      "translationZh": "如果机器人在训练期间从未遇到过任何与之稍有相似的内容，它能否对一个全新的提示——比如“布置一场惊喜生日派对”——作出有意义的响应？尤其是在大多数数据集都是由人数有限的人员，在学术实验室里、在严格受控的条件下采集的情况下？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a7cd74b3eea3557",
      "translationZh": "我们从以数据为中心的视角理解泛化：将其视为从数据中抽象出更广泛模式的过程——本质上就是“拉远视角”，以揭示与具体任务无关的结构和原则。这种视角转变强调，推动泛化的不仅仅是模型架构，数据集的多样性也发挥着重要作用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d8e580304072f9f9",
      "translationZh": "为什么机器人领域还没有迎来自己的 ImageNet 时刻？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d37967a2f076327",
      "translationZh": "迄今为止，大多数机器人数据集都来自结构化的学术环境。即使我们将规模扩大到数百万次示范，往往仍会有某一个数据集占据主导地位，从而限制多样性。ImageNet 汇集了互联网规模的数据，更全面地捕捉了真实世界；相比之下，机器人领域还缺乏一个多样性相当、由社区驱动的基准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c799c35a48311848",
      "translationZh": "这主要是因为，收集机器人数据需要实体硬件，也需要投入大量精力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d2feb7c62b5412ae",
      "translationZh": "构建 LeRobot 社区",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "175c2208273e63e5",
      "translationZh": "因此，我们在 LeRobot 致力于让机器人数据收集变得更加触手可及——无论是在家中、学校，还是其他任何地方。我们正在：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37e1c701fa58a859",
      "translationZh": "简化录制流程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b560c36bd19060a9",
      "translationZh": "简化上传至 Hugging Face Hub 的流程，以促进社区共享",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1b1a3df34c574594",
      "translationZh": "降低硬件成本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d439997b9018d94",
      "translationZh": "我们已经看到了成果：Hub 上由社区贡献的数据集数量正在迅速增长。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df2c944c872f57f1",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Hub 上 lerobot 数据集数量随时间的增长情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4bbb655bb80dd25f",
      "translationZh": "如果按机器人类型细分已上传的数据集，就会发现大多数贡献都面向 So100 和 Koch，这使得机械臂和操作任务成为当前 LeRobot 数据集生态的主要关注点。不过，重要的是要记住，其潜力远不止于此。自动驾驶汽车、辅助机器人和移动导航等领域同样有望从共享数据中受益。这一势头让我们离这样的未来更近了一步：数据集体现的是全球共同的努力，而不只是某个实验室或机构的贡献。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "074175269626043a",
      "translationZh": "lerobot 数据集按机器人类型的分布情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac98efaafc8cb7cb",
      "translationZh": "下面仅列举几个出色的社区贡献数据集，展示机器人技术可以多么多样、富有想象力：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "38828ca9490c071b",
      "translationZh": "lirislab/close_top_drawer_teabox:: 对家用抽屉进行精确操作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "85eed0fe5cebc9b5",
      "translationZh": "Chojins/chess_game_001_blue_stereo: 使用立体相机配置采集的一场完整国际象棋对局",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6556b0c711c04ace",
      "translationZh": "pierfabre/chicken：是的——一个与色彩缤纷的动物模型互动的机器人，其中还有一只鸡 🐔",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "14b54fe4a9984c4e",
      "translationZh": "在 Hugging Face Hub 的 LeRobot 标签下探索更多富有创意的数据集，并在 LeRobot Dataset Visualizer 中以交互方式查看它们。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f5843d876fcb1562",
      "translationZh": "负责任地扩大规模",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36b3c5a8cad07e4b",
      "translationZh": "随着机器人数据采集变得更加普及，数据整理成为下一个挑战。尽管这些数据集仍是在受限的环境配置中采集的，但它们是迈向经济实惠的通用机器人策略的关键一步。并非每个人都能用上昂贵的硬件——但通过共享基础设施和开放协作，我们可以构建出远为强大的成果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3445a7dcc3379999",
      "translationZh": "🧠 “泛化能力不是在实验室里解决的——而是由世界教会的。”我们的数据越多样，模型的能力就越强。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c70aa67f3441403f",
      "translationZh": "更好的数据 = 更好的模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "063c7eab48d27662",
      "translationZh": "为什么数据质量很重要？低质量的数据会导致下游性能不佳、输出存在偏差，以及模型无法泛化。因此，高效、高质量的数据采集对于推进通用型机器人策略的发展至关重要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c37794e2ce0af22c",
      "translationZh": "尽管视觉和语言领域的基础模型依托海量、网络规模的数据集蓬勃发展，机器人领域却缺少一个“机器人互联网”——一个由现实世界交互构成的庞大、多样的语料库。相反，机器人数据分散在不同的具身形态、传感器配置和控制模式中，形成了彼此孤立的数据孤岛。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ae40e547d074107",
      "translationZh": "为克服这一问题，Gr00t 等近期方法将训练数据组织为金字塔结构，其中：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0cef182422d01e3d",
      "translationZh": "大规模网络和视频数据构成基础",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "19c2651b9aec5df0",
      "translationZh": "合成数据通过仿真增加多样性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9fcd06a3cfb278d2",
      "translationZh": "顶层的真实世界机器人交互使模型扎根于物理执行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08f3aa12bbcda93d",
      "translationZh": "在这一框架下，高效的真实世界数据采集不可或缺——它将学到的行为锚定在实际机器人硬件上，并弥合仿真到现实的差距，最终提升机器人基础模型的泛化能力、适应能力和性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be1eefc5288c47d8",
      "translationZh": "通过扩大真实世界数据集的规模和多样性，我们可以减少异构数据源之间的碎片化。当数据集在环境、具身形态或任务分布方面彼此割裂时，模型就难以跨领域迁移知识。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04cb128015bcbeb9",
      "translationZh": "🔗 真实世界数据发挥着连接纽带的作用——它将抽象先验与立足现实的行动对齐，使模型能够构建更连贯、更具迁移能力的表征。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b701dc35437471fa",
      "translationZh": "因此，提高真实机器人交互数据的占比不仅能增强真实性，还能从结构上加强金字塔各层之间的联系，从而形成更稳健、能力更强的策略。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91a748a3e520aa8f",
      "translationZh": "机器人基础模型训练的数据金字塔。改编自 Gr00t（Yang 等，2025）。从下到上，数据量逐渐减少，而具身特异性逐渐增加。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "61cdffae9aecb9c5",
      "translationZh": "当前社区数据集面临的挑战",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f19e833f88ad8776",
      "translationZh": "在 LeRobot，我们已开始开发一套自动化数据整理流水线，用于对社区数据集进行后处理。在后处理阶段，我们发现了几个有待改进的方面，这些改进可以进一步提升数据集质量，并促进今后更有效的数据整理：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "51593317f2754745",
      "translationZh": "1. 任务标注不完整或不一致",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3ad6bec375b6452",
      "translationZh": "许多数据集缺少任务描述、缺乏细节，或对要执行的任务表述含糊。语义目前处于认知的核心，这意味着理解任务的背景和具体要求对机器人的表现至关重要。详尽的表述不仅能确保机器人准确理解预期要求，还能为认知系统提供更广泛的知识和词汇。歧义可能导致错误的理解，进而导致错误的动作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28232c592c7bbf8a",
      "translationZh": "任务指令可能存在以下情况：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c6c094bc0054f9cb",
      "translationZh": "为空",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ec737fe2ca4d0b4",
      "translationZh": "过短（例如“握住”“向上”）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "82824a085e38eb80",
      "translationZh": "没有任何具体含义（例如“task desc”、“desc”）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3af23c9b1a472e92",
      "translationZh": "子任务级别的标注往往缺失，导致难以对复杂的任务层级结构进行建模。虽然可以用 VLM 来处理这一问题，但最好还是由当前数据集的作者提供任务标注。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3cfc46dc967b62e2",
      "translationZh": "2. 特征映射不一致",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "042cf2a1c529928f",
      "translationZh": "像 images.laptop 这样的特征，其标签含义模糊：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5ee5572355db971f",
      "translationZh": "有时是第三人称视角",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "16250d63efad1031",
      "translationZh": "有时则更像是夹爪（腕部）相机",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c764294f1fa4e848",
      "translationZh": "手动将数据集特征映射到标准化名称既耗时又容易出错。我们或许可以使用 VLM 或计算机视觉模型对相机视角进行分类，从而自动推断特征类型。不过，注意到这一点有助于获得更干净的数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "433f1329792ebb15",
      "translationZh": "3. 低质量或不完整的回合",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "189f30ece99204b1",
      "translationZh": "一些数据集包含：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0b03e5615fc945b8",
      "translationZh": "仅有 1 帧或极少帧的回合",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ca5341113a273ee0",
      "translationZh": "被手动删除的数据文件（例如，删除 .parquet 文件后未重新索引），从而破坏了序列一致性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d6c6b047395ab30b",
      "translationZh": "4. 动作/状态维度不一致",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3721f97c274eaeb4",
      "translationZh": "不同的数据集使用不同的动作或状态维度，即使针对同一种机器人（例如 so100）也是如此。一些数据集的动作/状态格式存在不一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "16a47a6dc753f00a",
      "translationZh": "什么样的数据集才是好数据集？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5e8180698ed8a75",
      "translationZh": "既然我们已经知道，创建高质量数据集对于训练可靠且具有泛化能力的机器人策略至关重要，我们便整理了一份最佳实践检查清单，帮助你采集有效数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "324421638cca1117",
      "translationZh": "图像质量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9b3a46a1da550abf",
      "translationZh": "✅ 最好使用两个摄像机视角",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5c9f83a155faeb32",
      "translationZh": "✅ 确保视频拍摄稳定（无抖动）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec699a1e582c8898",
      "translationZh": "✅ 保持中性、稳定的照明（避免色调过黄或过蓝）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ca4066a403c4a83e",
      "translationZh": "✅ 确保曝光一致、对焦清晰",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ecf8380e192f90a7",
      "translationZh": "✅ 主控机械臂不应出现在画面中",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "672ee49dc15ed277",
      "translationZh": "✅ 画面中唯一移动的物体应是从动机械臂及其操作的物品（避免出现人体四肢或身体）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8b7f8d39a8fbdc0c",
      "translationZh": "✅ 使用静态、不分散注意力的背景，或对背景施加受控变化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "932832a7681fbe3c",
      "translationZh": "✅ 以高分辨率录制（至少 480x640 / 720p）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2ca5d5b4b4d156a7",
      "translationZh": "元数据与录制规范",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9c4c679f9318b0d0",
      "translationZh": "✅ 在元数据中选择正确的机器人类型。如果你使用的自定义机器人未列入官方 LeRobot 配置注册表，我们建议查看 LeRobot Hub 上现有数据集中类似机器人的命名方式，以确保一致性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6933820f3072f718",
      "translationZh": "✅ 以约每秒 30 帧（FPS）的帧率录制视频",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a0994876b32a82f0",
      "translationZh": "✅ 如果删除回合，请务必相应更新元数据文件（我们将提供适当的工具来编辑数据集）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f27a7ceee6b59bba",
      "translationZh": "特征命名约定",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a44c8505c72f650a",
      "translationZh": "为所有相机视角和观测使用一致且易于理解的命名方案：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a5649a42cb2fcef",
      "translationZh": "格式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1889f03338b79bba",
      "translationZh": "示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c35952a281be51b8",
      "translationZh": "避免使用特定设备名称：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c22ffeb06638c298",
      "translationZh": "对于腕部安装的摄像头，请注明朝向：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d56d4504b6b1409a",
      "translationZh": "图像.手腕.右",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1786b79280e990d6",
      "translationZh": "一致的命名可提高清晰度，并帮助下游模型更好地理解空间配置和多视角输入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d0a7b106234045aa",
      "translationZh": "任务标注",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42ce22ee49c3984f",
      "translationZh": "✅ 使用 task 字段清晰描述机器人的目标",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fbf4b54a354ca531",
      "translationZh": "示例：拿起黄色的乐高积木，并将其放入盒子中",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c1111ad3de92a548",
      "translationZh": "✅ 保持任务描述简洁（25–50 个字符之间）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "706c115d7c8acdeb",
      "translationZh": "✅ 避免使用 task1、demo2 等含糊或笼统的名称。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40d72b8701d05bfe",
      "translationZh": "下面，我们提供了一份清单，作为数据集录制的指南，列出了数据收集过程中需要注意的关键事项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a367629e8dcb5f0",
      "translationZh": "图 4：数据集录制检查清单——一份分步指南，旨在确保真实世界数据收集的一致性和高质量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "758574500000161e",
      "translationZh": "你能如何提供帮助？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8440ac682763dec",
      "translationZh": "下一代通用机器人不会由某一个人或某一个实验室独力打造——它们将由我们所有人共同打造。无论你是学生、研究人员，还是仅仅对机器人感到好奇，都可以通过以下方式参与：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fc25af618bf40946",
      "translationZh": "🎥 录制你自己的数据集——使用 LeRobot 工具，从你的机器人采集并上传高质量的数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dd96d7948c2fbdd4",
      "translationZh": "🧠 提升数据集质量——遵循我们的检查清单，清理你的录制数据，并帮助为机器人数据设立新标准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6b79fd352572ad05",
      "translationZh": "📦 为 Hub 做贡献——上传数据集、分享示例，并探索其他人正在构建的项目。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "54c8e1a46ecceb2b",
      "translationZh": "💬 加入讨论——参与我们的 LeRobot Discord 服务器，提供反馈、提出功能需求，或帮助制定路线图。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5e1d7227ab72803e",
      "translationZh": "🌍 壮大这场运动——向你的社团、课堂或实验室介绍 LeRobot。更多贡献者 = 更好的泛化能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ef58a22c955a35e",
      "translationZh": "开始录制，开始贡献——因为通用机器人的未来，取决于我们今天共同构建的数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "community-contributed",
      "briefZh": "社区贡献的",
      "explanationZh": "指由社区成员共同提供，而非仅由单一机构制作或收集。"
    },
    {
      "term": "curation",
      "briefZh": "数据整理",
      "explanationZh": "在数据语境中，指对数据进行筛选、组织和质量管理。"
    },
    {
      "term": "generalization",
      "briefZh": "泛化能力",
      "explanationZh": "指模型在全新场景、未见过的物体及不同条件下仍能执行任务的能力。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Vision-Language-Action (VLA) models",
      "briefZh": "视觉语言动作模型",
      "explanationZh": "将视觉信息、语言与动作相结合，用于支持机器人理解并执行任务的模型。"
    },
    {
      "term": "dexterity",
      "briefZh": "灵巧性",
      "explanationZh": "指机器人灵活、精细地完成物体操作等动作的能力。"
    },
    {
      "term": "semantic levels",
      "briefZh": "语义层面",
      "explanationZh": "指涉及含义与概念理解的层面，与文中的物理和视觉层面并列。"
    },
    {
      "term": "semantics",
      "briefZh": "语义",
      "explanationZh": "此处指任务所包含的意义与目的，例如物品应放在哪里、应选用什么工具。"
    },
    {
      "term": "generalist policies",
      "briefZh": "通用策略",
      "explanationZh": "指能够应对多种任务和环境，而非仅针对单一任务的机器人行动策略。"
    },
    {
      "term": "co-training",
      "briefZh": "联合训练",
      "explanationZh": "此处指利用不同来源或类型的数据集共同训练模型。"
    },
    {
      "term": "heterogeneous datasets",
      "briefZh": "异构数据集",
      "explanationZh": "指在环境、任务、机器人形态等方面存在差异的数据集。"
    },
    {
      "term": "robot embodiments",
      "briefZh": "机器人具身形态",
      "explanationZh": "指机器人所具有的不同实体形态与身体配置，这些差异会影响其感知和行动方式。"
    },
    {
      "term": "abstraction level",
      "briefZh": "抽象层次",
      "explanationZh": "指训练数据所表达的信息处于具体动作、场景还是更概括的任务概念等层次。"
    },
    {
      "term": "data-centric",
      "briefZh": "以数据为中心",
      "explanationZh": "强调从数据的特征和多样性出发理解与改进模型能力的视角。"
    },
    {
      "term": "task-agnostic",
      "briefZh": "任务无关",
      "explanationZh": "不依赖某个具体任务，可适用于多种任务。"
    },
    {
      "term": "model architecture",
      "briefZh": "模型架构",
      "explanationZh": "模型各组成部分的结构及其连接方式。"
    },
    {
      "term": "demonstrations",
      "briefZh": "示范数据",
      "explanationZh": "供机器人学习的任务执行示范记录。"
    },
    {
      "term": "community-driven benchmark",
      "briefZh": "社区驱动基准",
      "explanationZh": "由社区共同推动构建、用于衡量和比较系统能力的标准或数据集。"
    },
    {
      "term": "recording pipeline",
      "briefZh": "录制流程",
      "explanationZh": "记录机器人操作及相关数据的一系列处理步骤。"
    },
    {
      "term": "community-contributed datasets",
      "briefZh": "社区贡献数据集",
      "explanationZh": "由社区成员提供并共享的数据集，而非仅由单一机构创建。"
    },
    {
      "term": "robotic arms",
      "briefZh": "机械臂",
      "explanationZh": "用于抓取、移动物体等操作任务的机器人执行机构。"
    },
    {
